{"speciesId":839,"names":{"fr":"Monthracite","es":"Coalossal","en":"Coalossal","ja":"セキタンザン"},"descriptions":[{"language":"fr","version":"sword","text":"Il est d’une nature paisible, mais si les humains tentent de piller ses mines, il enrage et brûle tout avec des flammes à 1 500 °C."},{"language":"es","version":"sword","text":"Aunque es de carácter sereno, monta en cólera si ve a seres humanos dañando una mina y reduce todo a cenizas con sus llamas a 1500 °C."},{"language":"en","version":"sword","text":"It’s usually peaceful, but the vandalism of mines enrages it. Offenders will be incinerated with flames that reach 2,700 degrees Fahrenheit."},{"language":"ja","version":"sword","text":"普段は 穏やかだが 人間が 鉱山を 荒らすと 怒りくるい １５００度の 炎で 焼きつくす。"},{"language":"fr","version":"shield","text":"Lorsqu’il s’engage dans un combat, son tas de charbon brûle et vire au rouge, ce qui répand de petites étincelles qui calcinent ce qui l’entoure."},{"language":"es","version":"shield","text":"Cuando se enzarza en un combate, la montaña de carbón arde al rojo vivo y esparce chispas que calcinan todo lo que le rodea."},{"language":"en","version":"shield","text":"While it’s engaged in battle, its mountain of coal will burn bright red, sending off sparks that scorch the surrounding area."},{"language":"ja","version":"shield","text":"戦いになると 石炭の 山が 真っ赤に 燃え上がり 火の粉を まき散らして 周囲を 焦がす。"}],"varieties":[{"id":839,"moves":[{"name":"mega-punch","learns":[[20,"machine",0]]},{"name":"fire-punch","learns":[[20,"machine",0],[25,"machine",0]]},{"name":"mega-kick","learns":[[20,"machine",0]]},{"name":"tackle","learns":[[20,"level-up",1],[25,"level-up",1]]},{"name":"body-slam","learns":[[20,"machine",0],[25,"machine",0]]},{"name":"take-down","learns":[[25,"machine",0]]},{"name":"flamethrower","learns":[[20,"machine",0],[25,"machine",0]]},{"name":"hyper-beam","learns":[[20,"machine",0],[25,"machine",0]]},{"name":"solar-beam","learns":[[20,"machine",0],[25,"machine",0]]},{"name":"fire-spin","learns":[[20,"machine",0],